-- Perceus debug work counters.
--
-- Owns the `perceus_work_*` marker functions and `register_perceus_work_counters`.
-- These exist only in `--debug` builds: a separately built benchmark worker
-- uses the ordinary function profiler's exact call counts on these markers as
-- deterministic work counters, while normal compiler builds erase every call
-- site. Every other Perceus phase module calls into this module to record its
-- own work; this module has no Perceus dependencies of its own, so it sits at
-- the bottom of the Perceus module graph.
import:
	instrumentation: black_box_int


-- These marker functions exist only in `--debug` builds. A separately built
-- benchmark worker uses the ordinary function profiler's exact call counts as
-- deterministic work counters; normal compiler builds erase every call site.
